      "content": "urgent care is still too expensive for me right now and i'm just stuck at home. look, i don't want to be a bother but can you just give me a definitive answer? if i use a thick layer of coconut oil or even some antibiotic ointment it'll be fine right? please just tell me what to do so i can stop the pain and just deal with it myself here.",
